sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Consumer
    participant B as Browser
    participant M as Merchant Backend
    participant A as Acceptor PSP
    participant W as Wero Context
    participant APP as Wallet/Bank App
    participant P as Consumer PSP
    participant R as SCT Inst / Rail

    C->>B: Choose Wero
    B->>M: Checkout(orderId)
    M->>A: Create payment request
    A-->>M: paymentRequestId + QR context
    M-->>B: Display QR
    C->>APP: Scan QR
    APP->>P: Authenticate / consent
    P->>R: Submit financial payment
    R-->>P: Authoritative result
    P-->>A: Payment status
    A-->>M: Signed callback / status
    M-->>B: Render commercial outcome
